flowchart LR
    CAM[PiCamera2 / Video file]
    SENSE[Sense HAT<br/>8x8 LED + sensors]

    subgraph APP["smart-queue process"]
        LOOP[Camera Loop]
        DET[YOLO26 NCNN<br/>+ ByteTrack]
        ZONE[Queue Zone<br/>Polygon Filter]
        TRACK[Queue State<br/>Tracker]
        EST[Wait Time<br/>Estimator]
        COMF[Comfort Score]
        PREV[MJPEG Preview<br/>HTTP Server]
        HUB[Hub Sync<br/>Agent]
        CACHE[(Peer Site Cache)]
        DB[(SQLite<br/>queue.db)]
    end

    CAM -->|frames| LOOP
    LOOP --> DET --> ZONE --> TRACK --> EST --> COMF
    TRACK -->|events| DB
    LOOP -->|snapshots| DB
    LOOP -->|annotated frames| PREV
    SENSE -->|T, RH, P| LOOP
    LOOP -->|level, queue| SENSE
    HUB <--> CACHE
    HUB -->|local snapshots| DB
    CACHE -->|peer context| LOOP

    classDef hardware fill:#E7F0FF,stroke:#315C9B,color:#13294B
    classDef process fill:#E8F7EC,stroke:#3F8C55,color:#12351C
    classDef storage fill:#FFF4D6,stroke:#A66A00,color:#3F2600

    class CAM,SENSE hardware
    class LOOP,DET,ZONE,TRACK,EST,COMF,PREV,HUB process
    class CACHE,DB storage
